# Minimal mmCIF fixture for altloc resolution tests.
# Residue 1 (ALA, chain A): backbone atoms have occupancy 1.00 (no altloc).
# CB exists as two altloc conformers: A (occ 0.70, coord 1.0 1.0 0.0)
# and B (occ 0.30, coord 1.0 2.0 0.0).  Max-occ winner is conformer A.
# This fixture mirrors altloc_two_conf.pdb for cross-format parity testing.
